-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3192ab1f-a7bf-485a-a7c1-385b65f6b4d7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c7c4c7ec-4d74-4324-8c4e-3de649091bec\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-65742a83-004e-4c68-9865-74a17d4a7f36\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-705bf884-56e8-4443-b960-5d6280b42d47\">- 7/29(수) 11:00 ~ 12:20 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a7becfdf-cb15-419e-8b06-ae93417940f6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-096b2d56-7eed-4426-8357-0c50f6f8eed1\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c3ac7dbb-df84-4220-9a09-fe9577535fcb\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7261b166-c0e5-44e3-81d7-73025b3f5417\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1bd51b74-86a8-420b-90bc-18ef8d5fb7aa\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ce895d40-8ea1-462c-9aa2-f5a557adb6c1\">1. 코어가 활성화된 적을 대상으로 하는 스킬이, 코어가 활성화되지 않은 상태의 일부 랩쳐에게도 피해를 입히는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e786f695-32bf-4c70-8095-6c5cd2513305\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eade3132-3bab-4fa6-9e62-aaf209213043\">[대상]</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d7d41d47-69be-4d83-a8c7-96e826f3a745\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cb72499d-065a-4cb0-8394-93da0779b147\">└ 마테리얼 H : 캠페인, 타워</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1d8cf770-4dab-4632-8a33-917698affc5d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-73cfe894-6480-4e63-8b19-48acbe37817f\">└ 인디빌리아 : 캠페인, 타워</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e893ebe-5a41-47c4-b77e-43ae933db061\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-792e7d55-6b71-4265-a74e-d0699269a2da\">2. 일부 랩쳐의 활성화된 코어를 공격할 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b1b42458-057c-4956-93f1-b45d5b7719ab\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-37db4190-5f71-4a01-b343-acbc379e5fe4\">[대상]</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-af405aba-d547-488b-9a70-ee67e66458c4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-62b9602d-c720-4513-aca0-c76c55117991\">└ 모노아이 : 캠페인, 타워, 시뮬레이션 룸, 스토리 이벤트</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-04070639-07c3-47a8-a24d-a7aca958ff47\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eb860f8e-3311-457e-926a-73c47fa1f281\">└ 패서바이 : 캠페인</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ca4b204b-ebe9-430e-8d7c-0ed9358ba9c6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6614d246-11c9-43ed-8c3a-bfd85794fd3c\">3. 공정성을 위해 솔로 레이드 뮤지엄 홀3의 인디빌리아 파츠 코어가 파괴된 후 일반 코어가 활성화되도록 패턴을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b22c3e19-d1f7-4d2e-804a-faa2f36af775\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f5f251fc-fd2f-4c27-a6ac-e9f34431a563\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ee9248b0-0732-4c87-bb6f-10d06b50a988\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-73799382-f90d-4ef0-a5b8-6c1869a21274\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c6bea1c-373e-4324-9df3-1822ea0a0c88\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-71d097cf-a639-43fc-ab57-f65c4382d1c5\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-55829bc6-ae82-4c62-b4fa-3d6edadbf8ad\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b383fd3b-53e8-4443-8d81-4d3724e275a6\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7acfedd2-f8ad-418d-8dee-766e6791615f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f575ac18-282e-4ead-b8f0-26df1be07bde\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1221d3a5-5108-45f7-9595-9bba710dbaa3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ec86910f-f760-4bb3-af4f-a54f2fb14cae\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module